  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Stronger the ligand, larger the splitting energy &amp; higher the energy of absorption. Among the given options en is the strongest ligand due to ring formation than ammonia and than water. In all complex metal ion is same with same oxidation state.&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Ni</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>en</mi></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></munder><mo>&#62;</mo><munder><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Ni</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></munder><mo>&#62;</mo><munder><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Ni</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></munder></math></p></blockquote>"
